### =========================================================================
### backend/requests.http
### Arquivo de teste/documentação viva da API (extensão "REST Client" do VSCode).
### Clique em "Send Request" acima de cada bloco. Serve também de referência de
### payload para Postman/Insomnia/curl.
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@contentType = application/json
# Mesmo valor de API_KEY do backend/.env (vazio se a API estiver aberta).
@apiKey =

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### HEALTH
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Status da API + versão do yt-dlp
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Descobre a plataforma de uma URL (utilitário do front-end)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/detect?url=https://x.com/NASASpaceflight/status/1928909292305826184
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Capacidades da feature de corte/crop (ffmpeg disponível?)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/edit/capabilities
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}


### =========================================================================
### DOWNLOAD — X.COM (funciona sem cookies)
### =========================================================================

### Metadados (sem baixar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/twitter/info
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "url": "https://x.com/NASASpaceflight/status/1928909292305826184",
  "format": "mp4"
}

### Baixa em MP4 (melhor qualidade) — resposta binária em streaming
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/twitter/download
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "url": "https://x.com/NASASpaceflight/status/1928909292305826184",
  "format": "mp4",
  "quality": "best"
}

### Baixa só o áudio em MP3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/twitter/download
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "url": "https://x.com/NASASpaceflight/status/1928909292305826184",
  "format": "mp3"
}

### Download COM PROGRESSO — passo 1: inicia o job (devolve { "job_id": ... })
# @name startDl
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/twitter/download/start
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "url": "https://x.com/NASASpaceflight/status/1928909292305826184",
  "format": "mp4",
  "quality": "best"
}

### passo 2: consulta o progresso (repita até status == "finished")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/downloads/{{startDl.response.body.job_id}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### passo 3: baixa o arquivo pronto (streaming) e descarta o job
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/downloads/{{startDl.response.body.job_id}}/file
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Erro esperado: URL de outra plataforma (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/twitter/info
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ", "format": "mp4" }


### =========================================================================
### DOWNLOAD — YOUTUBE (pode exigir YOUTUBE_COOKIES_FILE / YOUTUBE_COOKIES)
### =========================================================================

### Metadados
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/youtube/info
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aqz-KE-bpKQ", "format": "mp4" }

### Baixa em MP4 na pior qualidade (rápido, bom para testes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/youtube/download
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aqz-KE-bpKQ", "format": "mp4", "quality": "worst" }

### Baixa em MP3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/youtube/download
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aqz-KE-bpKQ", "format": "mp3" }


### =========================================================================
### DOWNLOAD — INSTAGRAM (quase sempre exige INSTAGRAM_COOKIES_FILE / _COOKIES)
### =========================================================================

### Metadados de um Reel
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/instagram/info
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/SUBSTITUA_PELO_SHORTCODE/", "format": "mp4" }

### Baixa o Reel em MP4
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/instagram/download
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/SUBSTITUA_PELO_SHORTCODE/", "format": "mp4" }


### =========================================================================
### CUT & CROP  (multipart/form-data — envie um arquivo de vídeo)
### =========================================================================

### Corta de 00:00:01.5 a 00:00:05 e recorta 640x360 a partir de (100, 50).
### O REST Client substitui < pelo conteúdo do arquivo indicado.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/edit/cut-crop
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----form

------form
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="start"

1.5
------form
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="end"

5
------form
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="crop_x"

100
------form
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="crop_y"

50
------form
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="crop_w"

640
------form
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="crop_h"

360
------form
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="output_format"

mp4
------form
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="entrada.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./downloads/entrada.mp4
------form--
